ormal&E&C&B/font&C&B/field&C&Bitem type = &Epara_start&E/&C&B/p&C&G&Bp&C&G&Bfield id = &E0&E data = &ENO_DATA&E&C&Bfont v=&E2&E h=&E11&E w=&E0&E chs=&E1&E d=&Eeaaaaa&E fc=&EArial&E cl=&E0&E si=&E0&E sm=&E4490&E ss=&Enormal&E&C&B/font&C&B/field&C&Bitem type = &Epara_start&E/&C&Bfield id = &E0&E data = &ENO_DATA&E&C&Bfont v=&E2&E h=&E11&E w=&E0&E chs=&E1&E d=&Eeaaaaa&E fc=&EArial&E cl=&E0&E si=&E0&E sm=&E4490&E ss=&Enormal&E&C&Bitem type = &Enormal&E&C&B![CDATA[Since the refrigerant is a subcooled liquid of 25 degC, draw a vertical line (4) that passes through a saturated liquid line for 25 degC (Point E). An intersection point (Point 3) of the line (4) and the line (1) shows a position before the expansion valve.]]&C&B/item&C&B/font&C&B/field&C&B/p&C&G&Bp&C&G&Bfield id = &E0&E data = &ENO_DATA&E&C&Bfont v=&E2&E h=&E11&E w=&E0&E chs=&E1&E d=&Eeaaaaa&E fc=&EArial&E cl=&E0&E si=&E0&E sm=&E4490&E ss=&Enormal&E&C&B/font&C&B/field&C&Bitem type = &Epara_start&E/&C&B/p&C&G&Bp&C&G&Bfield id = &E0&E data = &ENO_DATA&E&C&Bfont v=&E2&E h=&E11&E w=&E0&E chs=&E1&E d=&Eeaaaaa&E fc=&EArial&E cl=&E0&E si=&E0&E sm=&E4490&E ss=&Enormal&E&C&B/font&C&B/field&C&Bitem type = &Epara_start&E/&C&Bfield id = &E0&E data = &ENO_DATA&E&C&Bfont v=&E2&E h=&E11&E w=&E0&E chs=&E1&E d=&Eeaaaaa&E fc=&EArial&E cl=&E0&E si=&E0&E sm=&E4490&E ss=&Enormal&E&C&Bitem type = &Enormal&E&C&B![CDATA[Point E obtained from a saturate pressure of 1.045 MPa for 25 degC is the same.]]&C&B/item&C&B/font&C&B/field&C&B/p&C&G&Bp&C&G&Bfield id = &E0&E data = &ENO_DATA&E&C&Bfont v=&E2&E h=&E11&E w=&E0&E chs=&E1&E d=&Eeaaaaa&E fc=&EArial&E cl=&E0&E si=&E0&E sm=&E4490&E ss=&Enormal&E&C&B/font&C&B/field&C&Bitem type = &Epara_start&E/&C&B/p&C&G&Bp&C&G&Bfield id = &E0&E data = &ENO_DATA&E&C&Bfont v=&E2&E h=&E11&E w=&E0&E chs=&E1&E d=&Eeaaaaa&E fc=&EArial&E cl=&E0&E si=&E0&E sm=&E4490&E ss=&Enormal&E&C&B/font&C&B/field&C&Bitem type = &Epara_start&E/&C&Bfield id = &E0&E data = &ENO_DATA&E&C&Bfont v=&E2&E h=&E11&E w=&E0&E chs=&E1&E